<title>NETHERLANDS: Lanschot starts ASM Int. as outperformer.</title>
<headline>Lanschot starts ASM Int. as outperformer.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of February 1997 note.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>ASM Int.	  Technology    26.60   Van Lanschot</p>
<p>COMMENT: OUTPERFORMER (initiating coverage). Although 1997 earnings of semiconductor equipment supplier ASM International will be supported by a higher dollar, an earnings decline is inevitable. However, the recovery potential in 1998, driven by new systems development and the targeting of new markets, we rate ASMI an outperformer on a 12-month basis. ASMI pays practically only tax in HongKong and will continue to do so until 2000.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS	 P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     2.03	13.1    9.2   0.00</p>
<p>    1997		  1.30	20.5   12.1   0.00</p>
<p>    1998		  2.40	11.1    8.0   0.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
